# Reference only: install an actual root:root 0600 /etc/rustgate/rustgate.env.
# No active credentials or dummy values are shipped; an empty file fails startup.
# systemd EnvironmentFile syntax, not a shell script: no export or substitutions.
# RUSTGATE_CONTROL_PLANE_TOKEN must be a securely generated random bearer of at
# least 32 visible ASCII bytes without whitespace (openssl rand -hex 32).
# RUSTGATE_UPSTREAM_KEYS must be a JSON object mapping non-secret key IDs to
# provider credentials, enclosed in single quotes for EnvironmentFile parsing.
# Provision both assignments with real secrets using a trusted secret manager or
# root-only editor. Do not put secrets in shell arguments/history or source control.
# Do not source this file or enable shell tracing while handling secrets.
